#Project code notes

### Model rough Parameter counts:

- CNN, Resnet18: roughly 11.2M
- Transformer, ViT (tiny, 12 layers): ~5–6M (was tiny×2 / 24 layers ≈ 10.7M)
- Hybrid, both: CNN + ViT above (exact count printed at run time)
- `hybrid10/`: same hybrid model on CIFAR-10 (mirrors CNN10 / transformer10)
